                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "As of `a933d3dc1968 (\"Add linux-next specific files for 20250723\")` from https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/next/linux-next.git/ there's no mention of the string `bmc-device`:\n\n```\n[I] 0 andrew@heihei ~/s/k/l/origin ((a933d3dc))> pwd\n/home/andrew/src/kernel.org/linux/origin\n[I] 0 andrew@heihei ~/s/k/l/origin ((a933d3dc))> git grep bmc-device\n[I] 0 andrew@heihei ~/s/k/l/origin ((a933d3dc)) [1]> \n```\n\nWe don't accept userspace changes in other repositories without a corresponding upstream driver (e.g. `dbus-sensors`).\n\nPlease do the work to get the driver upstream, then change can be revisited."
                },
                {
                    "file": "hbb-lid-mmio.cpp",
                    "line": 14,
